1005:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Returns the SYSCLK frequency
1006:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   The system frequency computed by this function is not the real
1007:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *         frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined
1008:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *         constant and the selected clock source:
1009:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is HSI, function returns values based on HSI_VALUE(*)
1010:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is HSE, function returns a value based on HSE_VALUE(**)
1011:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is PLL, function returns values based on HSE_VALUE(**),
1012:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *           HSI_VALUE(*) Value multiplied/divided by the PLL factors.
1013:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     (*) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in py32e407_hal_conf.h file,
1014:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *               but the real value may vary depending on the variations
1015:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *               in voltage and temperature.
1016:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     (**) HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in py32e407_hal_conf.h file,
1017:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *                user has to ensure that HSE_VALUE is same as the real
1018:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *                frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
1019:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *                have wrong result.
1020:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *
1021:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   The result of this function could be not correct when using fractional
1022:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *         value for HSE crystal.
